  "universal_guidelines": [
    "DO NOT use generic 'Messenger Blue' (#0084FF). Use the defined Electric Indigo.",
    "DO NOT use solid backgrounds for sidebars if possible; use glassmorphism to create depth.",
    "Ensure all interactive elements have `data-testid` attributes.",
    "Use 'Manrope' for all headings to give a geometric, modern feel.",
    "Implement a 'Kinetic Typography' empty state: When no chat is selected, show a large, subtle animated text saying 'SYNC' or 'CONNECT'.",
    "Message bubbles should have a subtle 'pop' animation when they appear.",
    "Use 'Sonner' for all toast notifications.",
    "Dark mode is NOT just black. Use the defined 'Obsidian' (#09090B) and 'Zinc' scales.",
    "Scrollbars should be hidden or custom styled to be very thin and subtle."
  ],
  "instructions_to_main_agent": "You are building 'Sync', a next-gen messaging app. Your goal is to make it feel 'weightless' and 'fluid'. Focus on the glassmorphism effects in the sidebar and the smooth transitions of message bubbles. Use the provided image URLs for avatars. Strictly follow the color palette. For the empty state in the chat window, create a visually interesting typographic composition using the brand name 'Sync'."
}